Revenue dashboard won't load, spinning 30+ sec then this:

GET /dash/v3/render/8834 504
{"error":"timeout","query_id":"q_2291"}

We're integrating Northwind's Identity API to auto-enroll users in MFA during provisioning for North Analytics, and calls to /v1/mfa/enroll are returning 422 with 'invalid_enrollment_state' for any user created in the last hour via SCIM. Users provisioned before today enroll fine. We have 91 seats and a company-wide SSO rollout scheduled for this week that's now blocked. Log excerpt:

POST /v1/mfa/enroll
{"user_id": "usr_88a2f", "method": "totp"}
422 Unprocessable Entity
{"error": "invalid_enrollment_state", "detail": "user not in pending_mfa state"}

This is blocking our go-live.

getting this on enrollment:
{"error":"mfa_enrollment_failed","code":409,"detail":"factor already exists for user"}
can't re-enroll test users
